      "text": "My father was riding the motor cycle and I was pillion riding and after reaching Buwana Mandir, my father made a call to the same number and then the both went to railway crossing and after waiting there for some time, we were coming back but from one side two young persons with muffled faces came on motorcycle and after stopping their motorcycle near us, asked for the address of Gurbachan Singh but my father reply that he does not know.",
